 **Design:** [system-design.md#contracts](system-design.md#contracts)
 
+### Specialty directory
+
+<a id="req-vet-003"></a>
+
+The clinic also answers the inverse question: which veterinarians hold a given specialty. A read-only page lists every specialty the clinic knows by its stored name. Each specialty carries the veterinarians holding it, each shown by first name then last name. All specialties appear on one page, never a page at a time. A veterinarian holding no specialty appears under none. The page is reached by its address; no navigation entry leads to it yet `[REQ-VET-003]`.
+
+**Done when:**
+- `[REQ-VET-003]` given the clinic's specialties, when the specialty directory is opened, then every specialty is listed by its stored name on a single page.
+- `[REQ-VET-003]` given a specialty held by veterinarians, when the specialty directory is opened, then each holder is listed under it by first name then last name.
+- `[REQ-VET-003]` given a veterinarian holding no specialty, when the specialty directory is opened, then that veterinarian appears under no specialty.
+
+**Edge cases:**
+1. A veterinarian holding two specialties appears under each of them.
+2. A specialty held by no veterinarian is still listed, with no veterinarian beneath it.
+
